  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.3": "封缄圣痕",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.flavor": "起舞吧，为每个欢笑的往日，与不会到来的明日——无物可使你我分离。",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.description": "获得显现、异化与封印阶段所记录材料的特性，必须在超越砧上烙印。",

  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.slight": "轻微超载",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.moderate": "明显超载",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.severe": "严重超载",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.critical": "极度超载",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.tooltip": "%s：%s",
  "modifier.esotericism_tinker.stigmata.overload.tooltip_1": "%s",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.name": "举扬",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.manifestation": "它开始举起触及之物；无人知晓下一位会是谁。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.alienation": "它渐渐遗忘轻重之别；敌人与持有者同受举扬。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.sealing": "它只知道万物终将离地。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.armor.manifestation": "它自你的身躯升起，举扬周遭的一切。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.armor.alienation": "它不再记得谁应当被留下。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.exaltation.armor.sealing": "它终将把你也献给天空。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.name": "咒降",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.manifestation": "它留下污秽；停留者自会承受代价。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.alienation": "它拒绝让污秽消散；生者皆难幸免。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.sealing": "它终将使土地本身成为诅咒。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.armor.manifestation": "它从你的伤口逸散，侵染靠近者。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.armor.alienation": "它不再分辨谁曾流血。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.malediction.armor.sealing": "它让你的立足之地化作疫土。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.name": "天谴",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.manifestation": "雷霆开始回应你的攻击，却从不保证落在应许之地。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.alienation": "雷霆渐渐遗忘最初的目标；旁观者与你，都可能成为它的见证。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.sealing": "圣痕已无须借你的意志呼唤雷霆；凡立于其下者，皆可能承受天谴。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.armor.manifestation": "雷霆开始环绕你的身侧，等待降临。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.armor.alienation": "雷霆渐渐忘记自己为何而来，只记得你曾呼唤过它。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.judgement.armor.sealing": "你已不再引来雷霆；你只是它选择降临的地方。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.name": "附执",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.manifestation": "它唤来怨灵；执念尚知归处。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.alienation": "怨灵渐渐遗忘主人。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.sealing": "最终，唯有执念仍在追猎活人。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.armor.manifestation": "你的伤痛吸引徘徊之灵。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.armor.alienation": "它们已分不清仇敌。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.obsession.armor.sealing": "它们终究只忠于自己的怨恨。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.name": "孕生",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.manifestation": "它孕育弱小之物，并静候收获。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.alienation": "它开始偏爱成长中的猎物。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.sealing": "它早已不在乎谁才是真正的猎物。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.armor.manifestation": "你的伤痛催生新的生命。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.armor.alienation": "它们因流血而诞生。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.incubation.armor.sealing": "它们终会反过来寻找新的养料。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.name": "渎秽",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.manifestation": "大地开始记住你的足迹。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.alienation": "大地渐渐忘记自己原本的模样。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.sealing": "后来者已无法寻回旧日的大地。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.armor.manifestation": "大地开始回应你的驻足。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.armor.alienation": "你所立之处，渐渐脱离了原本的模样。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.defilement.armor.sealing": "后来者只会以为，大地本该如此。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.name": "吞灭",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.manifestation": "它开始索取你的饥饿。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.alienation": "它渐渐忘记了何谓满足。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.sealing": "它终于开始吞食持有者。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.armor.manifestation": "每一道创伤都使它更加饥渴。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.armor.alienation": "它渐渐以饥饿丈量痛苦。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.devouring.armor.sealing": "它终究会吞下每一次受击。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.name": "圣餐",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.manifestation": "它接受你的灵知，作为暂时的圣餐。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.alienation": "它渐渐偏爱灵知，而非食粮。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.sealing": "它终于将一切经验都视作祭品。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.armor.manifestation": "每一次创伤都献上些许灵知。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.armor.alienation": "它开始期待下一次献礼。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.sacrament.armor.sealing": "它终于学会从痛苦中进食。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.name": "献祭",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.manifestation": "它愿饮一滴鲜血，以免自身磨损。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.alienation": "它渐渐忘记了铁与血的区别。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.sealing": "它已不认识铁，只认识鲜血。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.armor.manifestation": "它愿以鲜血偿还每一道裂痕。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.armor.alienation": "它开始偏爱流血，而非破损。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.offering.armor.sealing": "它终将要求每一道伤痕都以鲜血偿还。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.name": "焚献",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.manifestation": "火焰开始停留在你的身后。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.alienation": "火焰渐渐忘记了自己的祭坛。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.sealing": "火焰终于向一切能够燃烧之物献祭。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.armor.manifestation": "火焰开始回应你的创伤。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.armor.alienation": "火焰渐渐忘记应当焚烧谁。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.immolation.armor.sealing": "火焰终究不会留下任何旁观者。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.name": "苦修",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.manifestation": "它赐下重负，也赐下力量。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.alienation": "它渐渐以沉重塑造你的身躯。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.sealing": "它终于使苦修成为你的本性。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.armor.manifestation": "每一次创伤都使重负更加真实。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.armor.alienation": "你的脚步开始学会忍耐。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.penance.armor.sealing": "最终，连站立本身都是修行。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.name": "御权",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.manifestation": "它承认驾驭者。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.alienation": "它渐渐遗忘徒步之人。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.sealing": "它终究只侍奉仍在驾驭者。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.armor.manifestation": "它接受御者的庇护。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.armor.alienation": "它开始轻视徒步者。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.dominion.armor.sealing": "离开坐骑者，再无庇护可言。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.name": "月相",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.manifestation": "满月开始回应你的圣痕。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.alienation": "月光渐渐遗忘白昼。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.sealing": "月相之外，再无恩典。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.armor.manifestation": "月光开始停留在你的身侧。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.armor.alienation": "白昼渐渐失去它的庇护。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.nocturne.armor.sealing": "唯有月光仍愿承认你。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.name": "天极",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.manifestation": "高天开始俯视你。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.alienation": "苍穹渐渐遗忘低地。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.sealing": "唯有高天仍愿承认你的存在。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.armor.manifestation": "苍穹赐予你片刻庇护。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.armor.alienation": "低地渐渐失去恩典。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.zenith.armor.sealing": "离开苍穹者，再无庇护可寻。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.name": "幽渊",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.manifestation": "深渊开始回应你的脚步。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.alienation": "深渊渐渐遗忘地表。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.sealing": "唯有深渊仍记得你的名字。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.armor.manifestation": "深处开始接纳你的存在。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.armor.alienation": "地表渐渐遗弃了你。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.abyss.armor.sealing": "终有一日，你将属于深渊。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.name": "圣福",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.manifestation": "祝福开始承认你的名字。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.alienation": "祝福渐渐遗忘凡人。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.sealing": "唯有蒙选者仍受其眷顾。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.armor.manifestation": "恩典开始停留在你身旁。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.armor.alienation": "恩典渐渐远离众人。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.beatitude.armor.sealing": "失去蒙选者之名，便失去一切庇护。",

  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.name": "圣绝",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.manifestation": "诅咒开始承认你的名字。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.alienation": "诅咒渐渐遗忘洁净。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.sealing": "唯有受弃者仍受其眷顾。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.armor.manifestation": "灾厄开始与你同行。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.armor.alienation": "洁净渐渐远离你的身影。",
  "stigmata_consequence.esotericism_tinker.anathema.armor.sealing": "当诅咒离去时，庇护也将一并离去。",

